From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 09:15:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Replace the Vico charts with a lightweight Canvas chart

The main screen and the per-app screen only need a simple bar chart with a
value axis, day/hour labels, grid lines and an average line. Draw it with a
Compose Canvas instead of instantiating a Vico CartesianChartHost and
feeding a model producer, which removes the chart setup from the
composition and drops the last Vico API usage from the app code (R8 can
then strip the dependency from release builds).

The new chart keeps the previous 192dp height, nice-minute value axis,
every-4-hours / per-weekday labels, rounded bars, dashed average line and
theme colors.
